0%3D","duration":9329,"title":"权宠医女","video_desc":"该剧讲述的是22世纪医学博士元卿凌因实验事故穿越成民国宇文大帅五子宇文皓弃妇，凭医学知识和才智在大帅府解难题、化危机，改变宇文皓偏见获尊重，二人从敌对、欢喜冤家，再到最后相互扶持。《权宠医女》郭静和安子杨主演，为《桃花马上请长缨》同系列短剧。","series_id":"7520484180182961177","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233108E873FB5C06A9A28C8B6C\",\"rank\":\"2\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7520484180182961177\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.0378924235701561,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7926116585731506,\\\"finish\\\":0.0013670254265889525,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.07196357101202011,\\\"like\\\":0.0541987344622612,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.1320439577102661,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.13746649026870728}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7520484180182961177","play_cnt":361861,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"朵粒猫","sub_title":"爱情·穿越","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":70,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5123,\"name\":\"穿越\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5123&categoryName=穿越&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5174,\"name\":\"矛盾和解\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5174&categoryName=矛盾和解&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5208,\"name\":\"医生\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5208&categoryName=医生&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5261,\"name\":\"少帅\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5261&categoryName=少帅&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5340,\"name\":\"民